gra - 3M Gloss Black - Acura Sherway - Close up", "tag": ""}], "eid": "4c9998b"}], "padding": "0px 0px 20px 0px", "maxWidth": null, "minHeight": null, "background": "#FFFFFF", "bgImage": null, "bgSize": null, "bgPosition": null, "bgRepeat": null}, {"id": "b45e69d", "blocks": [{"type": "columns", "cols": [{"width": 74.87, "blocks": [{"type": "text", "html": "<h4>Spooky Red Vampire and Black Vinyl Decals on Acura!</h4> <p>As Halloween is approaching, you might want to check out these vinyl colors: Red Vampire and Gloss Black – both from 3M. Our client wanted to customize his three cars, two Acura Integra and an Acura Sherway. Check out the pictures below for a closer look for your upcoming Halloween-inspired wrap!</p> <p>This personal series of projects was a spectacular product of a consultation with our graphic designers. After deciding on a vamp fall color palette of saturated red and a glossy black on red black and light grey backgrounds, our client wanted to get the installation process started. Our wrap experts with 10+ years of experience handled all three cars’ installations professionally. Each vehicle was finished in less than 48 hours, resulting in the shortest downtime possible, and getting the cars back with their cool custom designs to drive around.</p> <p>If you would like to personalize your car, truck, boat, or other personal items – as long as it fits into our garage and has a smooth surface, we would love to wrap it! For your inspiration or your next wrap with Vinyl Wrap Toronto, do not forget to check out our <a href=\"/vinyl-car-wrap-our-portfolio/\">Portfolio</a>. To check out more car wraps, <a href=\"/car-wraps/\">click here</a>.</p> <p><a href=\"/contact/\">Get a Free Quote </a>today by filling out the form and our team will get back to you as soon as possible. You can reach us at <a href=\"tel:416-746-1381\">416-746-1381</a> or email us at <a href=\"mailto:info@vinylwraptoronto.com\">info@vinylwraptoronto.com</a>. You can also visit us at <a href=\"https://g.page/vinylwraptoronto?share\">24 Ronson Dr, Unit 1, Etobicoke, ON, M9W1B4.</a></p> <p>Don’t forget to follow us on <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/vinylwraptoronto/\">Instagram</a>, <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/vinylwraptoronto/\">Facebook</a>, <a href=\"https://twitter.com/vinylwraptdot\">Twitter</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.pinterest.ca/vinylwrapstoronto/\">Pinterest</a> to hear about our special deals, creative wrap projects, and vehicle branding.</p>", "style": "text-align:start;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5em;font-weight:300", "eid": "85e4764"}, {"type": "postnav", "prev": {"href": "/decals-chevy-silverado-avery-360-demolition/", "text": "Prev Previous Decals & Lettering for 360 Demolition’s Chevy Silverado | Avery Dennison"}, "next": {"href": "/decals-ford-f150-avery-aiden-equipment-rental/", "text": "Next Yellow Avery Dennison Lettering & Decals for Aiden Equipment Rental’s Ford F150 – Best Decals in the GTA – Get Free Quotes Next"}, "eid": "0144f5b"}]}, {"width": 25.0, "blocks": [{"type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Limited Time Offer", "href": null, "style": "text-align:center;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:22px;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:500", "eid": "6026500"}, {"type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Get a Standard 3M or Avery Manufactured Full Wrap for a Tesla at", "href": null, "style": "text-align:center;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4em;color:var( --e-global-color-a8178e9 );font-weight:500", "tag": "p", "eid": "adce94b"}, {"type": "heading", "level": 3, "text": "$4,500 $3,500", "href": null, "style": null, "eid": "a36b238"}, {"type": "button", "text": "Claim Now", "href": "#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aopen%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6IjIyMDU1IiwidG9nZ2xlIjpmYWxzZX0%3D", "icon": null, "style": "text-align:center;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:500;text-transform:uppercase", "eid": "e4d3235